    "detailed_description": "<h1>1 Year Birthday</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1 Year Birthday</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/1f8559e62eb6e518715425817e62a1bc.avif?t=1750775320\" width=732 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grub Truck has turned 1 years old! And to celebrate we're doing a giveaway on our Discord server!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who has played the game and left a review!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Cook, Plan &amp; Decorate as you run your very own food truck business. Serve Customers, Buy &amp; Sell Trucks, Strategise Menus &amp; Complete Quests as you become the next budding Grub Truck entrepreneur!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/92f80f72414ab104553d55e2eb7de9ec.poster.avif?t=1750775320\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/92f80f72414ab104553d55e2eb7de9ec.webm?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/92f80f72414ab104553d55e2eb7de9ec.mp4?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook &amp; Serve!</h2>Cook from a variety of dishes (from Tacos and Burgers to Onion Rings and Side Salads) and serve them fast to keep your hungry customers happy!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/d1683fd6f8b8154d6373aa4d881c803e.poster.avif?t=1750775320\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/d1683fd6f8b8154d6373aa4d881c803e.webm?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/d1683fd6f8b8154d6373aa4d881c803e.mp4?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy/Sell Trucks &amp; Hire Managers!</h2>Invest in new trucks and hire managers to enhance your daily business operations, or sell your older models to free up extra capital.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/bda3fd80543576a3f62e24c153b5d3ae.poster.avif?t=1750775320\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/bda3fd80543576a3f62e24c153b5d3ae.webm?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/bda3fd80543576a3f62e24c153b5d3ae.mp4?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design &amp; Decorate your Truck</h2>Buy new appliances, sell old ones and decorate your truck to attract more potential customers.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/6dced1b312c47e003ced9cb7f560ae1d.poster.avif?t=1750775320\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/6dced1b312c47e003ced9cb7f560ae1d.webm?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/6dced1b312c47e003ced9cb7f560ae1d.mp4?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Player Quests</h2>Choose from a selection of playable characters as you attempt to achieve their quests whilst navigating their diverse quirks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now!</h2>Ready to Turn Your Passion into Profit? Wishlist the game or play the free demo - available now!",
    "about_the_game": "Cook, Plan &amp; Decorate as you run your very own food truck business. Serve Customers, Buy &amp; Sell Trucks, Strategise Menus &amp; Complete Quests as you become the next budding Grub Truck entrepreneur!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/92f80f72414ab104553d55e2eb7de9ec.poster.avif?t=1750775320\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/92f80f72414ab104553d55e2eb7de9ec.webm?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/92f80f72414ab104553d55e2eb7de9ec.mp4?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook &amp; Serve!</h2>Cook from a variety of dishes (from Tacos and Burgers to Onion Rings and Side Salads) and serve them fast to keep your hungry customers happy!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/d1683fd6f8b8154d6373aa4d881c803e.poster.avif?t=1750775320\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/d1683fd6f8b8154d6373aa4d881c803e.webm?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/d1683fd6f8b8154d6373aa4d881c803e.mp4?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy/Sell Trucks &amp; Hire Managers!</h2>Invest in new trucks and hire managers to enhance your daily business operations, or sell your older models to free up extra capital.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/bda3fd80543576a3f62e24c153b5d3ae.poster.avif?t=1750775320\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/bda3fd80543576a3f62e24c153b5d3ae.webm?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/bda3fd80543576a3f62e24c153b5d3ae.mp4?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design &amp; Decorate your Truck</h2>Buy new appliances, sell old ones and decorate your truck to attract more potential customers.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/6dced1b312c47e003ced9cb7f560ae1d.poster.avif?t=1750775320\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/6dced1b312c47e003ced9cb7f560ae1d.webm?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733690/extras/6dced1b312c47e003ced9cb7f560ae1d.mp4?t=1750775320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Complete Player Quests</h2>Choose from a selection of playable characters as you attempt to achieve their quests whilst navigating their diverse quirks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now!</h2>Ready to Turn Your Passion into Profit? Wishlist the game or play the free demo - available now!",
    "short_description": "Grub Truck is a food truck simulation game where you cook up mouthwatering meals, strategise enticing menus, set the perfect prices, complete quests and decorate your trucks with style. Invest your earnings wisely to upgrade your fleet as you build, cook, and conquer the culinary scene!",
